ook at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-24T11:29:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What qualities make the perfect coach? We're borrowing from the best","description":"If we can build a coach in a lab, we can start with these qualities and skills.","published":"2026-11-24T11:23:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50476785/building-perfect-coach","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC to consider termination of LSU's membership at Dec. 3 meeting","description":"For the second time this year, the SEC is threatening to hold a vote of its chancellors and presidents on whether to kick LSU out of the league, according to a filing in federal court in Alabama on Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T12:52:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50577602/sec-consider-termination-lsu-membership","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia defensive coordinator Glenn Schumann agrees to coach Florida State","description":"Georgia's Glenn Schumann, one of the country's top defensive coordinators and part of a staff that has the Bulldogs at No. 1 in the CFP rankings, agreed to a five-year deal to become the next coach at Florida State, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T02:51:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577665/uga-defensive-coordinator-schumann-coach-florida-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Aiden Flora, nation's leading rusher, re-signs with Iowa State for next season","description":"Iowa State running back Aiden Flora, who leads the nation in rushing, announced Monday that he has re-signed with the Cyclones for next season.","published":"2026-11-23T23:57:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577520/aiden-flora-nation-leading-rusher-re-signs-iowa-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas A&M names John Thornton interim athletic director effective Dec. 1","description":"John Thornton will take over as interim athletic director at Texas A&M, effective Dec. 1, replacing the departed Trev Alberts.","published":"2026-11-23T22:07:34.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50576559/texas-names-john-thornton-interim-ad-effective-dec-1","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Giants DC Dennard Wilson interviews for HC job at alma mater Maryland","description":"Giants defensive coordinator Dennard Wilson had a virtual interview recently for the vacant head coaching job at Maryland, sources told NFL Network.","published":"2026-11-23T21:22:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50575838/sources-giants-dennard-wilson-interviews-maryland-job","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4867887/terrance-carter-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr."},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Terrance Carter Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr.","description":"American football tight end","touched":"2026-11-22T04:17:57Z","intro":"Terrance Carter Jr. is an American college football tight end for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Carter Jr. attended Harker Heights High School in Harker Heights, Texas, and committed to play college football for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns over Arkansas State."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"LOUISIANA\nAs a freshman in 2022, Carter Jr. took a redshirt. In 2023, he hauled in 28 receptions for 255 yards and three touchdowns. In week 8 of the 2024 season, Carter Jr. made seven catches for 149 yards and a touchdown in a 34-24 victory over Coastal Carolina. During the 2024 season, he recorded 48 catches for 689 yards and four touchdowns. After the 2024 season, Carter Jr. entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS TECH\nCarter Jr. transferred to play for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He is expected to be the Red Raider's starting tight end."}]}}